flowchart TB
  L["Logs, journal or posture probes"] --> P["Recognise, minimise and redact"]
  P --> Q["Seal envelope: evidence ID, hash chain and checkpoint in one local transaction"]
  Q --> T["Sign batch manifest; encrypt the request to Keen's pinned key and sign it; send over verified HTTPS"]
  T --> A{"Request signed by the agent's current key?"}
  A -->|Yes| E{"Encrypted to a Keen key that is still held?"}
  E -->|Yes| V{"Envelopes canonical, valid for their catalogue and listed in the signed manifest?"}
  E -->|"No (421)"| K["Fetch Keen's key and check it against the pinned identity"]
  K --> T
  V -->|Yes| D{"Evidence ID already stored?"}
  D -->|Same hash| OK["Return success, encrypted with the request's one-time key"]
  D -->|New| S["Record chain position, redact with custody record, store artifact and event; commit"]
  S --> OK
  OK --> C{"Response opens with that key?"}
  C -->|Yes| R["Remove acknowledged envelopes from the queue"]
  C -->|No| B
  A -->|No| H["Pause delivery; retain envelopes"]
  V -->|No| H
  D -->|Different hash| H
  T -->|Network error or retryable response| B["Back off and retry the same envelopes"]
  B --> T
